sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Desktop as Desktop App
    participant Cognito as Amazon Cognito<br/>(User Pool)
    participant QuickService as Amazon Quick Service
    participant TTI as Trusted Token Issuer<br/>(IAM Identity Center)

    User->>Desktop: Launch and select Enterprise sign-in
    Desktop->>QuickService: Request discovery configuration
    QuickService-->>Desktop: Cognito endpoints, Client ID, scopes
    Desktop->>Desktop: Generate PKCE code verifier + challenge
    Desktop->>Desktop: Bind localhost:18080 listener

    Desktop->>Cognito: GET /oauth2/authorize<br/>(code challenge, scopes)
    Cognito->>User: Present login page
    User->>Cognito: Authenticate (email + password + MFA)
    Note right of Cognito: MFA enforced via User Pool config
    Cognito-->>Desktop: Authorization code<br/>(via localhost:18080 redirect)
    Desktop->>Desktop: Shut down localhost:18080 listener

    Desktop->>Cognito: POST /oauth2/token<br/>(authorization code + PKCE verifier)
    Cognito-->>Desktop: Access token, ID token, refresh token

    Desktop->>QuickService: Validate session (access token)
    QuickService->>TTI: Validate token via JWKS<br/>(email claim mapping)
    QuickService-->>Desktop: Session established

    Desktop->>Desktop: Store tokens in OS credential vault
